{"id": "official:sentence:4567a5a3-b36e-4e09-bb86-dd1d7a55bfd7", "text": "你爸爸每天骑车上班。", "shortMeaning": "你爸天天骑自行车去单位。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cac9c343-7a2e-4f67-95ba-65881fdb3ee7", "text": "你犯得上这样做吗？", "shortMeaning": "这事值得你这样做吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f5684f1f-1c87-4b3f-bad8-b1616eb128e8", "text": "你猜得出这个迷语吗？", "shortMeaning": "这个谜面你猜得出来吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:208e1141-bb1c-4f45-99a4-8820f7a1c599", "text": "你现在可以删除它。", "shortMeaning": "现在你可以把它删掉。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:23f6e43c-2446-4a8d-adb4-53b81e710d3b", "text": "你现在可以开始了。", "shortMeaning": "现在你可以动手了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:09ea353c-09a4-434e-948b-f8c985a0d311", "text": "你现在带着手机吗？", "shortMeaning": "手机在你身上吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0d78bbe5-4a37-4a3b-9e27-bc53f8affedf", "text": "你现在很是心不在焉啊。", "shortMeaning": "你这会儿心思完全不在场。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:78afc951-1ab6-4add-9d8f-c701f7e14a04", "text": "你现在想对此做点什么吗？", "shortMeaning": "眼下你想为这事做点什么吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0418c9aa-7fcc-478e-9510-3f8f61a9363d", "text": "你现在感到痛苦吗？", "shortMeaning": "你现在心里难受吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:851e8f78-69da-4061-a561-6d358d88d4fd", "text": "你现在手头儿有钱吗？先借我点儿。", "shortMeaning": "你眼下有钱吗？先借我一点。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:845788a4-0d6f-4925-a54f-69eff8c61bdb", "text": "你现在有几块电池呀？", "shortMeaning": "你手边现在有几节电池？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f20c041f-df7e-4925-a4d5-246929230927", "text": "你现在的薪水够用吗？", "shortMeaning": "你现在的工资够花吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e332d817-a3ee-44b8-aa25-dd89dffb3a62", "text": "你现在西班牙语说得非常好了。", "shortMeaning": "你的西班牙语现在讲得很不错了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:52849e9e-5888-45cc-91e0-c48f0aeaa547", "text": "你班上最幽默的人是谁？", "shortMeaning": "你们班里谁最会逗乐？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d9357104-e05c-49e2-8bfd-911e83c27d34", "text": "你理发要长一点还是短一点？", "shortMeaning": "头发你想留长些还是剪短些？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:45513b4d-237a-4a10-9cb2-3a40db0ae840", "text": "你甘愿做一个教书匠吗？", "shortMeaning": "你甘心一辈子当教书先生吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4fd01454-95a3-4d72-8edc-662cbc7f8521", "text": "你生日的时候，我送你一辆自行车。", "shortMeaning": "过生日那天，我送你一辆单车。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b6f46e2e-3de6-4af0-bb3e-ffa5b21f7d45", "text": "你用什么方式减压？", "shortMeaning": "你靠什么法子放松？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b94a0dd2-3a31-4b7c-ae2f-7ac69036b21c", "text": "你用什么方式释放压力？", "shortMeaning": "压力大时你怎么排解？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f235b6f9-cf74-42a6-86ba-79820300b49f", "text": "你用你的照相机做了什么？", "shortMeaning": "你的相机你拿去干了什么？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c6de6414-beab-45ae-85bd-c533f4554129", "text": "你用哪一个浏览器？", "shortMeaning": "你平时上哪款浏览器？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:bc0d9e87-d94c-40b5-9c04-f899e99998e3", "text": "你用完了把它放回去。", "shortMeaning": "用罢就放回原处。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f1ca190f-4208-4421-a9cb-5afc6b6e67de", "text": "你用完这本书，就把它放回原处啊。", "shortMeaning": "这本书看完了，记得搁回原位。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:94c8aacd-a034-4a96-995c-b4b3f48811b3", "text": "你用相机做了什么？", "shortMeaning": "相机你用来做了什么？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:df5361b2-4a80-4c1c-bb5f-4b5854c9ae64", "text": "你用过我的照相机吗？", "shortMeaning": "我的相机你动过吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1baf82d8-3fe9-4629-b2dc-6149c70a1ee1", "text": "你用那种指法弹不会觉得费劲吗？", "shortMeaning": "那样按弦弹，你不觉得吃力吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a1da7221-2131-4ca0-a0e4-4afe74da9609", "text": "你用钢笔写的字，橡皮擦当然擦不掉。", "shortMeaning": "钢笔写的字迹，橡皮当然擦不去。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2baf996c-5dea-4ff0-b359-2d444b11266c", "text": "你的一位老师打电话我告诉你今天没上学。", "shortMeaning": "你一位老师打电话来，说你今天没去学校。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ff336468-3877-4aab-895f-27284c0da55a", "text": "你的一切我都知道。", "shortMeaning": "你的事我没有不知道的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:af65bb49-c22d-424c-ba1d-7f9866fa50d9", "text": "你的中文学得怎么样了？", "shortMeaning": "你中文进展如何？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:25446f5d-0809-487b-aa3d-ae6b11f7d38c", "text": "你的中文已经登峰造极了。", "shortMeaning": "你的中文已经到了顶。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7ff43d94-27b8-4dd0-82dc-315165716d92", "text": "你的主意听起来是个好主意。", "shortMeaning": "你这个点子听着不错。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:411350e1-2806-4326-bc97-282a8cf6098a", "text": "你的书什么时候出版？", "shortMeaning": "你那本书哪天出？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9a191ce5-0a8b-4766-9e3f-f7168c9eadc2", "text": "你的书是这本还是那本？", "shortMeaning": "哪一本是你的书，这本还是那一本？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:95f3dc2d-c000-4d75-8019-2c38a2f5cdb2", "text": "你的作文非常好，而且错误很少。", "shortMeaning": "你的文章写得很好，错处也不多。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4fa582d7-7947-45e2-9d3a-69fff6d5f574", "text": "你的匈牙利语说得很好。", "shortMeaning": "你匈牙利语讲得不错。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5e2e69ee-e927-4de1-bed5-28a161bd5e62", "text": "你的卧室里一个人也没有。", "shortMeaning": "你卧室里空无一人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e4764db1-ed74-4ca0-81bc-37d7df505ee3", "text": "你的卧室里没有人。", "shortMeaning": "你卧室里空着没人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d067aea3-009a-4b4d-a122-c2c83ef33879", "text": "你的名字已经从名单删除了。", "shortMeaning": "名单上你的名字已经划掉了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6df59a85-ede6-45d4-9792-d091e16498c2", "text": "你的名字怎么圈了？", "shortMeaning": "你的名字为什么被圈了起来？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3c32a962-81c9-443c-a796-5547581e3a4e", "text": "你的后门是开着的。", "shortMeaning": "你家的后门敞着。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e9d4d95d-b1bc-4088-9058-0b9f33c1b0a8", "text": "你的周末是怎么过的？", "shortMeaning": "周末你都怎么打发的？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ee790457-3dfd-4794-993d-ca1825815b68", "text": "你的命令已经传达了。", "shortMeaning": "命令已经传下去了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0c32a82d-44c2-4dc3-bef3-9859b1dcd877", "text": "你的嗓音对我来说就像是美人鱼的歌。", "shortMeaning": "你的声音在我听来正如人鱼之歌。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e8931161-3838-4d55-b3d0-a313a510cb1f", "text": "你的嘴唇上有东西。", "shortMeaning": "你嘴上沾了东西。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:31e822b6-c9c3-4cdd-b493-4ff87ce8d915", "text": "你的回答是正确的。", "shortMeaning": "你回答得完全正确。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:31591561-8fec-4826-96c3-cf31ed375663", "text": "你的国家的最低工资是多少？", "shortMeaning": "你们那儿最低工资是多少？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:246ce290-3f22-4c3d-b101-c2d3ff748ab1", "text": "你的城市有多少人口？", "shortMeaning": "你们那座城有多少人？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:345acda1-1954-4e61-baf6-5c815fd2d428", "text": "你的头发是什么颜色的？", "shortMeaning": "你的发色是哪种？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a7cc2677-751c-4ab2-a151-9a5e8fa20a91", "text": "你的头发有春天的味道。", "shortMeaning": "你的头发里有春天的气息。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:79301a6f-020a-46e5-a15d-cafa2a1c3f11", "text": "你的头发自然发色是什么颜色？", "shortMeaning": "你本来的发色是哪种颜色？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c5b8399d-4caa-499a-87fb-7c18dabe73e0", "text": "你的字典一直要放在手边。", "shortMeaning": "词典得一直搁在手边。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f5aee1d7-05bf-428d-92b4-71a3e47e0077", "text": "你的字写得真漂亮！", "shortMeaning": "你写的字真好看！", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:87fe09c5-c390-41e9-a622-840007e60759", "text": "你的寒假怎么过的？", "shortMeaning": "寒假你都是怎么过的？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3a3eab18-7be2-45f3-bec5-531e5d65f28c", "text": "你的差使换给我做干就好了。", "shortMeaning": "这差事要是交给我干就好了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2d3dff85-02d8-4497-bb93-6469ea8ff88f", "text": "你的帽子是哪一个？", "shortMeaning": "哪一顶帽子是你的？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:fb1f9d10-ec38-4348-9fcf-ea4215df65d1", "text": "你的彩色上衣非常醒目。", "shortMeaning": "你那件花上衣很扎眼。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f6f8fa16-2cc8-4149-b790-223ca0c35642", "text": "你的影响力是什么？", "shortMeaning": "你的影响力体现在哪里？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:aaf62f15-5a0a-4074-bcdf-87dadb612df0", "text": "你的想法很有建设性。", "shortMeaning": "你这个想法很有价值。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e1c87840-b57d-4912-b33f-d237891b1d76", "text": "你的想法简直无可挑剔。", "shortMeaning": "你这个念头挑不出毛病。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1f2d9a8b-f73b-4653-9728-5246089b5004", "text": "你的想法难以实践。", "shortMeaning": "你的设想很难真正行得通。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4938d8f7-29fc-435d-9742-5eaddd7773db", "text": "你的意思是这些都是徒劳的？", "shortMeaning": "照你这么说，这些全都白费？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b1b70048-f90b-4b7c-bad2-bc45e8404ac4", "text": "你的成功使我感到嫉妒。", "shortMeaning": "你成功了，我心里有些酸。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cac6a805-b712-44b1-9e03-199f09a82387", "text": "你的成功很大程度上取决于，你是否能够抓住机遇。", "shortMeaning": "你成不成事，多半看能不能抓住机会。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a705443a-c221-4da1-b04e-883ee154f85e", "text": "你的成功是应得的。", "shortMeaning": "你今天的成绩是挣来的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8f694e76-7bfd-4fee-906b-3f13703c3240", "text": "你的房子让人难以置信。", "shortMeaning": "你这房子好得让人不敢信。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3765bce1-d178-4d76-b9c1-3cb95a445400", "text": "你的房间里一个人也没有。", "shortMeaning": "你屋里空荡荡的，没人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:71ceb0a4-8817-4601-bbe4-af538df67d56", "text": "你的手表比我的贵。", "shortMeaning": "我那块表没你的值钱。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:af5b3501-f6f5-4cac-8886-8ec7c840398f", "text": "你的手表的质地要比我的更好些。", "shortMeaning": "你那块表的材质比我的好一些。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f46b6723-d555-4105-9e1a-27d9d3a5a30c", "text": "你的护照在你的夹克里吗。", "shortMeaning": "护照在你外套里吗。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4bc793c2-d242-4e89-8a9a-e2fbdb757cde", "text": "你的提议值得考虑。", "shortMeaning": "你这个建议可以想想。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9c4fe852-d8cd-4796-b668-ec4ebef52ce2", "text": "你的文法比你的呼吸好。", "shortMeaning": "你的语法水平比你的呼吸更过关。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:12ce4425-f970-49f1-b035-d47e113fb3b1", "text": "你的新电脑运行得好吗？", "shortMeaning": "新买的电脑用起来顺吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e0922b3d-e06a-430f-95eb-c70784f84e55", "text": "你的方法和我的不同。", "shortMeaning": "你的做法跟我的不一样。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f468c57a-15ce-4fc9-87b9-386a81539680", "text": "你的晚餐在烤箱里。", "shortMeaning": "你的晚饭在烤箱里放着。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0cd83310-cc63-4669-875d-c7bbe97d1fa1", "text": "你的期望薪资是多少？", "shortMeaning": "你期望拿到多少薪水？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e274adfd-5b90-4db3-b4da-e1fa5f9cbd4b", "text": "你的梦想实现了吗？", "shortMeaning": "你的愿望达成了吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:68c837ff-628e-4a4f-a783-dac28fa107ce", "text": "你的椅子和我的很像。", "shortMeaning": "你那张椅子跟我的很像。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:67c3f2aa-201d-45c5-b511-c0fc5fca87db", "text": "你的歌声像太平洋的海水一样清澈。", "shortMeaning": "你唱歌清亮得像太平洋的水。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cb503cd5-b6e7-4971-b854-1c88a01253c6", "text": "你的母亲现在在家吗？", "shortMeaning": "你妈妈这会儿在家吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e28aba80-c53f-4e89-97af-8d9ca2cd08ed", "text": "你的母语是中文吗？", "shortMeaning": "你的母语是汉语吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b86990f6-223b-40a9-a9bb-85e6fe1f2dbb", "text": "你的汉语在哪学的？", "shortMeaning": "你的中文是在哪儿学的？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d350ffee-849b-412a-8c49-204e6a853924", "text": "你的法语讲的很好。我希望可以讲的像你一样好。", "shortMeaning": "你法语说得很好，我盼着自己也能到你这份上。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:68dcb7d5-05d9-4bd7-939f-7342286ce613", "text": "你的派对来了多少人？", "shortMeaning": "你的聚会来了多少人？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d8b816d8-58c2-4a31-bc8f-3720fd3079ca", "text": "你的灵魂已经坠进地狱了。", "shortMeaning": "你的魂已经掉进地狱里了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6b93340e-46e0-432a-8627-ed38c64a3f44", "text": "你的爱情留下的疤痕使我想起我们。", "shortMeaning": "这段感情留下的伤，让我想起咱们俩。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8dd77864-5fa6-44b4-83f9-3ad12527ceb3", "text": "你的牙都黄了，赶紧去刷牙。", "shortMeaning": "你的牙都发黄了，快去刷一刷。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5bf21eaf-dd83-4993-ae28-b44cfec5cfee", "text": "你的狗刚刚咬了我。", "shortMeaning": "你的狗方才咬了我。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7c0773fd-0a0a-4112-8561-8a7e5ffac71d", "text": "你的狗叫什么名字？", "shortMeaning": "你的狗起名叫什么？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:74357f6c-69e3-4b8a-b159-5899a9255e8d", "text": "你的狗有多大呀？我的挺小的。", "shortMeaning": "你的狗有多大了？我那只还小。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6de9fec7-0264-4aee-93d2-e80a2d955ff3", "text": "你的狗看起来口渴了。", "shortMeaning": "你的狗好像渴了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9e03bfbb-40a1-4791-b818-e1becebf861d", "text": "你的猫为什么那么大？", "shortMeaning": "你的猫怎么那么大只？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a24bea55-2ba4-4357-a807-bd4c510f7244", "text": "你的理解有点望文生义了。", "shortMeaning": "你这样理解有点抠字面了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:42a53693-b8c3-427e-a369-bcddc067e581", "text": "你的生意进展如何？", "shortMeaning": "你的买卖做得怎么样？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1b29bf05-3c70-4bc1-b53a-721d29ca9cdf", "text": "你的生日是几月几号？", "shortMeaning": "你生日是哪月哪天？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c83c35e8-cdf0-42b2-a0bd-635475ec5c27", "text": "你的电脑有什么问题？", "shortMeaning": "你的电脑出什么故障了？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ee95e327-f3ad-4f9b-9af6-783dad475e19", "text": "你的电话出问题了吗？", "shortMeaning": "你的手机有毛病了吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a60a1c2c-2382-4211-841b-1b0ada45c954", "text": "你的电话号码是多少？", "shortMeaning": "电话该拨多少？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:83872d4c-915a-4a39-86ad-f8b0349e6b66", "text": "你的电话是：七八二一六六七四二。", "shortMeaning": "你留的号码为七八二一六六七四二。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c2186dcf-b218-4868-abbd-d636dac27fc3", "text": "你的眼睛不要看著地上; 看著我。", "shortMeaning": "眼睛别盯着地面，看着我。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
